xtv.com/static.fox4news.com/www.fox4news.com/content/uploads/2026/10/200/112/highland-park-united-methodist-umc-file-oct-2026_k_00.00.22.58.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1" data-srcset="https://images.foxtv.com/static.fox4news.com/www.fox4news.com/content/uploads/2026/10/200/112/highland-park-united-methodist-umc-file-oct-2026_k_00.00.22.58.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1" style="background:rgba(0,0,0,0);display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" data-v-5380752d></div> <noscript data-v-5380752d><picture class="responsive-image__picture" data-v-5380752d><source media="(min-width: 320px)" srcset="https://images.foxtv.com/static.fox4news.com/www.fox4news.com/content/uploads/2026/10/0/100/highland-park-united-methodist-umc-file-oct-2026_k_00.00.22.58.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://images.foxtv.com/static.fox4news.com/www.fox4news.com/content/uploads/2026/10/200/112/highland-park-united-methodist-umc-file-oct-2026_k_00.00.22.58.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x" data-v-5380752d> <img alt="Highland Park United Methodist Church split brings legal battle, dueling services" src="https://images.foxtv.com/static.fox4news.com/www.fox4news.com/content/uploads/2026/10/0/100/highland-park-united-methodist-umc-file-oct-2026_k_00.00.22.58.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1" data-v-5380752d></picture></noscript></div></a></div> <div class="info"><header class="info-header"><div class="meta"><!----></div> <h4 class="title"><a href="/news/highland-park-united-methodist-church-split-brings-legal-battle-dueling-services">Highland Park United Methodist Church split brings legal battle, dueling services</a></h4></header> <!----></div></article><article class="article story-4" data-v-13185694><!----> <div class="m"><a href="/news/deep-ellum-halloween-shootings-leave-least-4-dead"><div class="responsive-image__container" data-v-5380752d><div class="responsive-image__lazy-container" style="aspect-ratio:100 / 56;width:100%;max-width:100px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;background-image:url('https://images.foxtv.com/static.fox4news.com/ww